  "sketch": "// TMP36: V+ -> 5V, GND -> GND, OUT -> A0\nconst int sensorPin = A0;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  int reading = analogRead(sensorPin);\n  float volts = reading * 5.0 / 1023.0;\n  float celsius = (volts - 0.5) * 100.0;\n  Serial.print(\"Temperature: \");\n  Serial.print(celsius, 1);\n  Serial.println(\" C\");\n  delay(1000);\n}\n",
